<title>UK: SBC sets call, put warrants on US$/DEM.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call, put warrants on US$/DEM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued American-style call and put warrants of 10 million per series on dollar/mark, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls $100 nominal value.</p>
<p>The warrants are all listed on the Frankfurt and Duesseldorf exchanges and are available in minimum exercise lots of 100. Payment date is April 22, 1997 and maturities range between June 14, 1997 and September 13, 1999.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
